  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GCF-EBRD Egypt Renewable Energy Financing Framework</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme will support the construction of 8-12 projects with an aggregate capacity of 600 MW under the FiT scheme and the auction scheme, while in parallel supporting integration of renewables into the grid

&#x2022; The framework aims to scale up renewable energy capacity and reduce fossil fuel intensity, aligning with Egypt&#x2019;s articulated national policy.
&#x2022; The framework aims to be transformational and encourages private sector investment in an environment where currently there is negligible renewable capacity installed.
&#x2022; The projects envisaged to be developed under the proposed framework would be backed up by firm offtake contracts assuring developers of revenue certainty, with support from the Egyptian Government</narrative>
  </description>
